    "detailed_description": "STRATAGEM is a sci-fi arcade experience where you must save your crew members from certain destruction. Navigate the challenges of tracking ricochets and orbits.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Launch escape pods without sending active ones into colliding orbits.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fill the screen with as many pods as possible without letting them collide</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play on three different arenas in 4 different modes.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge your friends with local co-op multiplayer mode (coop or versus)</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Try to get a highscore in Endless or Timed modes</li></ul>",
